<http://purl.org/spar/mito/explicit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://purl.org/spar/mito/explicit> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> <http://purl.org/linked-data/registry#statusStable> .
<http://purl.org/spar/mito/explicit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "explicit"@en .
<http://purl.org/spar/mito/explicit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\nA type of mention according to which there is a direct, unambiguous, and literal naming or stating of something within a text.\n    "@en .
<http://purl.org/spar/mito/explicit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/spar/mito/> .
<http://purl.org/spar/mito/explicit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://purl.org/spar/mito/MentionType> .
<http://purl.org/spar/mito/explicit> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n    :my-mention a mito:Mention ;\n        mito:hasMentioningEntity :my-mentioning-entity ;\n        mito:hasMentionedEntity :my-mentioned-entity ;\n        mito:hasMentionType mito:explicit .\n    " .
